# DhurandharOS .gitignore
# Anything matched here stays local to the operator's machine and is never
# pushed to the public repo. Add patterns liberally — clean public repo wins.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Private workspace — brainstorming, drafts, notes, customer info
# Anything an operator might want to keep next to the code without shipping.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
BRAINSTORM.md
NOTES.md
PRIVATE.md
SCRATCH.md
TODO-private.md
*.local.md
*.private.md
*.draft.md
*.scratch.md
*.local
*.private

# Private workspace directories
brainstorming/
drafts/
private/
customer-notes/
ideas/
internal/
.notes/
.drafts/
.private/

# Operator-local memory variants (the public MEMORY.md and lessons.md
# remain tracked as templates / shipped decisions only)
MEMORY.local.md
lessons.local.md
DECISIONS.local.md
BLOCKERS.md

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & credentials — never commit
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
credentials/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor cruft
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.cursor/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build / dependency / temp
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.tmp/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
logs/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code local state
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/sessions/
.claude/cache/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/local.json
.claude/settings.local.json
